By the time we reach device i, every earlier tested device has lowered its battery by 1. So if `count` devices have been tested so far, device i's current battery is `batteryPercentages[i] - count` (floored at 0). Device i gets tested exactly when `batteryPercentages[i] > count`, and then `count` goes up by 1.

