    print("All tests passed!")
```

The outer `zip` pairs up the inner tuples at the same position in the two given tuples. The inner `zip` then pairs up the elements at the same position within those inner tuples, and each pair is multiplied. The results are collected back into a tuple of tuples, so the output has the same structure as the input.

